# Tokens system

- Consumir **semánticos** en UI (Compose).
- Semánticos en Figma deben ser **alias** de primitivas.
- Mantener paridad Light/Dark.

Fuentes:

- `docs/design-system/ds-governance.md`
- `docs/design-system/governance/source-of-truth-matrix.md`
- `.cursor/rules/utilities/icon-color-consumption.mdc`
- `docs/design-system/knowledge/semantic-consumption-policy.entry.json`

Compose UX en runtime (motion, TalkBack, edge-to-edge): `policy/android-compose-ux.md` — no sustituye consumo de tokens.
